{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんわんこ！\n伊藤純奈です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2015/03/23/3680567/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2015/03/23/3680567/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「命は美しい」発売しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Type-Cには研究生pv、\n通常盤には「ボーダー」が\n収録してあります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まず、研究生pvのお話から！\n監督さんは伊藤衆人さんでお世話に\nなるのは今回で3回目です(^｡^)\n相変わらず面白くてお話してて\n楽しいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2015/03/23/3680567/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"6人のpvだけどなんとなく2人ずつ\nペアになっていて純はみり愛とペア！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2015/03/23/3680567/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お揃いの洋服にそれぞれ武器を\n持って撮影！pvの中でも現実でも\n姉妹のようでした.....。\nお揃いの服着て車でも隣に座って\n寝るタイミングまで一緒だった♡笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"pvの中でも基本2人でわちゃわちゃ\nしてるので注目してみてください"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"面白いpvになってると思うので\nぜひ見て頂きたいです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2015/03/23/3680567/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、通常盤には\n琴子、絢音、蘭世、れな、みり愛\n純奈の6人での楽曲「ボーダー」が\n収録されています！1人1人の歌声が\nしっかりと聞けると思うので、\nぜひ聞いてみてください♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2015/03/23/3680567/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全握@京都ありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は七瀬さんとペアでした(^｡^)\n七瀬さん推しの方ありがとう\nございました！！楽しかった♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2015/03/23/3680567/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、ボーダー初披露でした〜\n緊張したけど楽しかった(((o(*ﾟ▽ﾟ*)o)))\n次もがんばります！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2015/03/23/3680567/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チェキ会来て下さったみなさん\nありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2015/03/23/3680567/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかったー(((o(*ﾟ▽ﾟ*)o)))\nまた機会があればやりたいなぁ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2015/03/23/3680567/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のこんぺいとーく"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆オムライスには何かける？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→ デミグラ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆1番妹って感じのメンバーは誰？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→ みりあかな。いや、あやねかな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆リラックス方法は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→ 友達に会う。メンバーに会う。\nいっぱい寝る。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はここまで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2015/03/23/3680567/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2015/03/23/3680567/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"〈最近の出来事〉"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・かりんとディズニーシーに行く。\n楽しかった！また行きたいな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2015/03/23/3680567/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・日奈子蘭世と\n「ウィズ〜オズの魔法使い〜」を観にいく。\n田野優花さんかっこよかった♡\nもっと色んな舞台を観に行きたいなぁ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2015/03/23/3680567/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みり愛と怜奈に遊ばれる純奈"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2015/03/23/3680567/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2015/03/23/3680567/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい！"}],"source":"archive"}